    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "YOUR UNITED\nMainliner\nFLICHT INFORMATION\nPACKET\nUNITED\nUNITED\nAIR LINES",
      "welcome\naboard\nIt is indeed a pleasure to extend to you service\nin the Mainliner manner. All of us at United\nare working toward one goal - your complete\nsatisfaction and comfort. If we do not\naccomplish this purpose, or should you have\nany suggestions for bettering our service,\nI will consider it a personal favor if you will\ndrop me a note. Your comments will\nreceive my prompt attention.\nШиндален\nVice-President - Transportation Services\nUnited Air Lines, Inc.\nOperating Base, Denver 7, Colorado\nUNITED AIR LINES\nCA 250 Printed in U.S. A",
      "breakfast menu\nThis menu prepared in United Air Lines Flight Kitchen\nat San Francisco, Frank Hurliman, Chef.\nFresh Fruit in Season\nMelba Toast\nOrange Marmalade\nHot Cakes\nCanadian Bacon\nVermont Maple Syrup\nCinnamon Roll Pecan Slice\nCoffee\nTea\nMilk\nUNITED AIR LINES",
      "UNITED",
      "co\nSKY\nRIDE\nFOR\nBABY\nThe Mainliner Way\nUNITED AIR LINES",
      "Call EN- 1-1172\naSK OP - ENTERPRISE\nUnited\nAir Lines\nROUTE OF\nTHE MAINLINERS\nTICKET FOR\nFLIGHT\nDATE\nYOUR MAINLINER LEAVES\nAIRPORT\nON\nDATE\nAT\nTRANSPORTATION TO THE\nAM\nPM\nAIRPORT\nLEAVES\nAT\nAM\nPM",
      "PASSENGER TICKET AND BAGGAGE CHECK\n162 B\n966018\nUNITED\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\n5959 So. Cicero Ave.,\nChicago 38, III., U.S. A.\nEach Passenger\nshould carefully\nexamine this ticket,\nparticularly the\nConditions on the\nnext page.\nMember of International Air Transport Association\nMember of Air Transport Association of America.",
      "System Timetable, July, 1952\nUNITED\nAIR LINES\nlow cost\nAIR TOURS\nGOLDEN WEST\nYELLOWSTONE\nYOSEMITE\nHAWAII\nALL SCHEDULES QUOTED IN STANDARD TIME"
    ],
